From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Winter <danielwinterw@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 17:15:05 +1100
Subject: [PATCH] skippy: add Whisper speech recognition

Build pinned whisper.cpp on this tree's ggml targets and fold it into
libllama when SKIPPY_WHISPER_SOURCE_DIR names its source, so the runtime
carries one ggml for both llama and Whisper.

skippy/asr.h opens a whisper.cpp model file outside skippy_model_open,
decodes WAV, MP3, and FLAC uploads to 16 kHz mono PCM with a file-local
miniaudio, and transcribes or translates with a fresh decoder state per
call, so calls on one model may run concurrently. Runtimes built without
whisper.cpp export the same symbols, leave
SKIPPY_FEATURE_SPEECH_RECOGNITION clear, and report UNSUPPORTED.

Bumps the Skippy ABI to 0.1.72.
